Recommended environment

Python 3.10 or later
Python 3.11 recommended

Core Python packages

numpy
pandas
scipy
librosa
joblib
scikit-learn
matplotlib

Additional package for deep-learning baselines

PyTorch with a build appropriate for the available CPU/GPU and CUDA environment

Optional development environment

Spyder through Anaconda or Miniconda. The run_*.py scripts can be opened and
executed directly with F5 after setting code/ as the working directory.
